            <title>[QCLVL3-1624] POS terminal GSLCAFE1printed an unusual transaction receipt</title>
                <link>https://qcmigration.atlassian.net/browse/QCLVL3-1624</link>
                <project id="10009" key="QCLVL3">Quickcharge Internal</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;POS terminal GSLCAFE1 printed an unusual transaction receipt, client wants to know what caused this and how it can be prevented from happening again. From a glance, it looks like the receipt is printing things processing on the server side (ex. MerchantID, Auth, etc.). Logs from that day are below.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
