                                                            <comment id="106174" author="712020:28b1e0c6-06c6-4e94-ba4f-35afe4004c3a" created="Mon, 10 Nov 2025 10:30:59 -0500"  >&lt;p&gt;Hello all, can we confirm what Payment Gateway they are using on these POS terminals?&lt;/p&gt;

